---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import Timeline from "../components/Timeline.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Samarth Jindal — software engineer building reliable distributed systems at scale."
>
  <PageHeader
    title="About"
    description="I'm a software engineer who builds distributed systems that stay correct and fast under real production load."
  />

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      My work centers on the infrastructure beneath products — streaming pipelines, storage
      layers, and the services that have to keep working when traffic spikes and things break.
      I've owned systems end to end: designing them, shipping them, carrying the pager, and
      fixing them after the inevitable 2 a.m. incident.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days I'm focused on platform reliability and growing toward technical leadership —
      and I'm exploring an MBA to pair that engineering depth with the business side.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Experience &amp; education</h2>
    <Timeline />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
